  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett projekt inom &quot;Cross Border Cooperation&quot; programmet. Det omfattar utbildning av handledare, utveckling av utbildningsmaterial och metodologi, utbildning i ledarskap och strategisk planering och kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring i samarbetsm&#xf6;jligheter inom EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a Cross Border Cooperation. It consists of training of trainers, development of training materials an methodology, training in management and strategic planning as well as know-how on  cooperation possibilities within the European Union.</narrative>
  </description>
